              <li><strong>RainWise Program</strong>: prevent flooding on  your property, add nice looking garden space, and collect rain water to use for  watering plants (while saving money on water bills). RainWise gives rebates,  cisterns, and rain gardens to eligible properties in Seattle. Learn more <a href="https://700milliongallons.org/rainwise/">here</a>.            </li>
